+# Perf history
+
+## UserPromptSubmit read path
+
+Benchmark: full-recall p95 of the `UserPromptSubmit` hook, adversarial synthetic 30-word vocabulary.
+
+- Before fix: **10.27 ms** p95.
+- Fix: drop terms with document frequency `df > n/3`, and use a Zipf-distributed vocabulary for term selection.
+- After fix: **1.82 ms** p95.
+
+Source: project benchmark run (`muninn-bench`), recorded in this project's own session transcripts. No separate written benchmark report was found in the repo to cross-check these numbers against.
